   "speech": "The chimney of a six-storey house hid for a minute the white vision drilling the air with its hollow roar, but Ranum, by a secret path of consciousness that we are powerless to comprehend, had already established the connection between the bandit and the passer-by with the dead soul. The man with the dead soul was to perish by a bomb dropped at the corner of Red Street and Black Street. Ranum made himself see him, slowly coming out of a shop towards the tram stop. He saw, too, the empty curve of air, not yet filled by the fall of the bomb, and understood that there was no time to lose.",
